                      <div class="pos-meter clk-countdown"><span data-clk-bar style="width:100%"></span></div>
                      <div class="pos-muted">Rotates in <b data-clk-left>15</b>s — scanning clocks the tech in, assigns their turn, and pushes a notification.</div>
                      <div class="pos-hint">The app login proves <b>identity</b>; the rotating QR proves <b>presence in the salon</b>. Two layers is what stops buddy-punching.</div>
